            </note>
            <note corresp="#d148-f2" n="36" xml:id="d148-f2-content">
                <p>In telegram No. 49, May 4, 9 a.m., the Chargé in Iran reported that the Afghan
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs on a visit to Tehran had also expressed a favorable
                    opinion of President Roosevelt’s message (740.00/1336).</p>
            </note>
